## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Backend | Python, FastAPI |
| Database | SQLite |
| Frontend | HTML/CSS/JavaScript (no framework — vanilla, single-file pages) |
| Auth | bcrypt password hashing, token-based sessions |
